  "summary": "Static-analysis ruleset cataloging IOCs as inert data",
  "details": "Package ships a set of static-analysis rules under dist/rules/, including SW003-encoded-payload.js and SW007-suspicious-egress.js, which catalog known-bad indicators as detection data: references to Buffer.from base64 decoding patterns and dynamic-DNS hostnames (no-ip, hopto.org, duckdns) are embedded as values in rule content used to flag such patterns in other code, not executed against the installer. No reachable network call, no credential or filesystem harvesting, no install/import-time execution of the catalogued strings, and no lifecycle scripts fetching remote content are present. The matched tokens are the detection ruleset's own IOC vocabulary.",
